{"articleNo":"649","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=649&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"▦2009전기대학원(추가모집) 합격자발표 및 등록안내▦","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2009.02.17","hit":"15093","attachments":[{"name":"720102d7-6ed4-40e8-86ab-2def31850189.jpg","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=649&attachNo=482"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; WIDTH: 520px; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; HEIGHT: 42px\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"1\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"541\" bgcolor=\"#cde4fa\" height=\"42\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">2009학년도 전기&nbsp;대학원(추가모집)&nbsp;합격자 발표 및 등록 안내</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<p align=\"center\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2009학년도 전기 대학원(추가모집) 합격을 진심으로 축하드립니다.</p>\n<p align=\"center\">-&nbsp;&nbsp; 아 &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;래&nbsp; &nbsp;-</p>\n<p><font color=\"#191970\"><strong>☞ 합격자 안내사항</strong> </font></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;본교 홈페이지에서 합격증 및 고지서를 출력하여 반드시 <strong><font color=\"#1e90ff\">지정된 기간 </font></strong><strong><font color=\"#1e90ff\">및&nbsp;&nbsp; </font></strong></p>\n<p><strong><font color=\"#1e90ff\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 등록장소</font></strong><font color=\"#808080\">에서</font> 등록절차를 마쳐야 합니다.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;▶ 등록기간 : <font color=\"#ff1493\">2009. 2. 19(목)&nbsp;</font>&nbsp;&nbsp; </p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;▶ 고지서출력방법 : <strong><font color=\"#228b22\">고지서출력&nbsp;바로가기 클릭/주민등록번호 입력/고지서출력</font><font color=\"#8b008b\"> </font></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"http://202.31.128.77:8080/ipsi/graduate/graduateHap1_app.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><strong><font face=\"굴림체\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><u>2009 전기 대학원 합격자 발표&nbsp;및 등록금고지서 출력 바로가기</u></span></font></strong></a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong><font color=\"#1e90ff\">&nbsp;</font></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ▶ 등록장소 : <strong>농협 전국지점(단위농협 포함)</strong> </p>\n<p></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;▶ 문의전화 : 478-7014~15<span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<strong><font color=\"#ff1493\">☞ 유의사항 : 미등록시 불합격처리됨</font></strong>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
